      "raw": "[quote=\"cmschex\"]\n\nAll I am reminded of is the Avatar the Last Airbender episode where they introduce Toph, who is fighting in that world&#39;s version of UFC. &nbsp;There is a fighter called The Boulder (who is an obvious parody of The Rock) who only refers to himself as &quot;The Boulder&quot; in every sentance. &nbsp;Now I need to get back to work on my A:TLA customr Sentinels decks...\n\n[/quote]\n\nI went back up and reread SIlverleaf&#39;s post, but imagined her growling &#39;The SIlverleaf&#39; the way The Boulder growled his name in his appearances.\n",
